      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/diller_nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village is located in the Blue River Valley near the historic routes of the Oregon and California Trails.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/diller_nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Land in Diller was originally part of the Otoe and Missouri Indian Reservation established in 1854.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
